    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86995" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδια-λύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dissolve</i> or <i>break up before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς τάξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.16.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.640e
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				934b6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>relax previously,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτυνούσῃ διαίτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(2).462
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>dilute previously,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Asclep.
				</span></i>
			(?)ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.586
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>mitigate first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.693
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>refute by anticipation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				49
			</span></i>
			<i>intr.</i><i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
